currently https://github.com/kubescape/node-agent/pull/805 is built against my mirror of this branch, and the test results and benchmarks are at the bottom.

There are edits to outdated comments, the only `relevant` part of this PR is moving this function from NA to storage to avoid duplication of logic.

```
func argMatches(profileArg, runtimeArg string) bool {
	if profileArg == DynamicIdentifier {
		return true
	}
	if strings.Contains(profileArg, DynamicIdentifier) || strings.Contains(profileArg, WildcardIdentifier) {
		return CompareDynamic(profileArg, runtimeArg)
	}
	return profileArg == runtimeArg
}
```




